   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Irregular parole",
   "texto": [
    "The same verbs of the irregular future: **ser** → **seria** (would), **ter** → **teria** (would), **fazer** → **faria** (would), **dizer** → **diria** (would say), **ir** → **iria** (would), **poder** → **poderia** (could), **saber** → **saberia** (would).",
    "When asked with courtesy: **Gostaria de** (I would like) + name or infinitive, **Poderia** (could) + infinitive."
